es.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Head back to Port Jeuno and click on the ??? at the toolbox for another cutscene and your Gallant Gauntlets. This completes the quest.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Optional\010\010The quest must be active or completed in order for the following coffers to yield their respective artifact attire.\010\010These coffers are not required to complete the quest.\010\010You must have Paladin as your main job when you open these coffers.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Guslam mentions something about armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones:\010\010Garlaige Citadel: Gallant Coronet\010\010Beadeaux: Gallant Breeches",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""}},["review"]="Imported from wiki; not verified in game.",["warnings"]="",["group"]="Quests",["jobs"]={"Paladin (PLD)"},["job_sources"]={{["job"]="Paladin (PLD)",["kind"]="Artifact quest",["page"]="Gallant Gauntlets",["revision"]="30487"},{["job"]="Paladin (PLD)",["kind"]="Artifact quest",["page"]="Gallant Coronet",["revision"]="19602"},{["job"]="Paladin (PLD)",["kind"]="Artifact quest",["page"]="Gallant Breeches",["revision"]="19606"},{["job"]="Paladin (PLD)",["kind"]="Artifact quest",["page"]="Borghertz's Stalwart Hands",["revision"]="3871"}}},{["id"]="wiki_5928",["title"]="Borghertz's Striking Hands",["page_title"]="Borghertz's Striking Hands",["kind"]="quest",["availability"]="unverified",["source"]="https://horizonffxi.wiki/Borghertz%27s_Striking_Hands",["revision"]="73748",["requirements"]="Start: Guslam \226\128\148 Upper Jeuno (H-8)\010Requirements: Monk 50+\010Must have started The First Meeting\010Items: Nest Coffer Key\010Key item: Old Gauntlets\010Key item: Shadow Flames\010Optional:\010Garlaige Coffer Key\010Beadeaux Coffer Key\010Previous: The First Meeting",["rewards"]="Temple Gloves\010Optional:\010Temple Crown\010Temple Cyclas",["repeatable"]="af",["summary"